              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gönkaaga ëyö nkanyoora Abhamitiani bhaaguria Yusubhu kömöntö wöndë iga Bhotibha öno aarëngë ömöhobhisa o Bharao, na ömökabhuruti wa abhasirikare bhu ubhurindi.",
          "type": "text",
